    "biography": "<p>Constrictor of Malaysian and Philippine jungles, 6–10 m long; eats most mammals.</p><p><strong>Powers:</strong> Enhanced Senses (Smell), Thermographic Vision</p><p><strong>Weaknesses:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> A successful predatory bite lets the python start constricting, damage or not: (Str)L Stun every Combat Turn. Heavy armor resists it normally; lighter Impact armor has no effect. It waits until the prey's heart stops before eating. Escaping the coils takes a Complex Action and a successful opposed Strength Test.</p><p><em>Printed stats: B 8 · Q 4 × 1 · S 10 · C — · I 1/5 · W 2 · E 6 · R 5; Attacks 8M. Running multiplier ×1; Perception 5. Cyberpirates p.150.</em></p>",
